Ficus was added in '''Beta 51.0''' as a 5/2/7 common monster with both the plant tribe and an aura effect. Whenever Ficus was on the board, and an ally plant died, Ficus gained +1 ATK. '''Beta 57.0''' changed its stats, reducing its cost by 1, but also reducing its HP by 1, to make it a 4/2/6.

=== Stats ===
ATK:

* 2 (Post Beta 51.0, Current)

HP:

* 7 (Post Beta 51.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 57.0, Current)

Cost:

* 5 (Post Beta 51.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 57.0, Current)

Abilities:

* Whenever an ally plant dies, gain +1 ATK. (Post Beta 51.0, Current)

Rarities:

* White (Common) (Post Beta 51.0, Current)
